I founded SoftServedWeb, a studio in Kochi that builds AI, web and AR/VR products for businesses, many of them in Saudi Arabia and the wider Middle East. I run it with four co-founders and look after people and sales.

My recent work is Revaik, our AI studio for regulated industries. Its first product, NovaPulse, sorts the voicemails patients leave at US medical practices and routes the urgent ones to the doctor on call.

Before SoftServedWeb I worked in blockchain and on ventures of my own.
